# What a tree passes before it is deployed: a line each, `name: command`, run in order from the repository's
# root by bash; the first that fails stops the rest. DJ proves trees against this file (docs/proofs.md).
Build the site: cd site && JEKYLL_ENV=production bundle exec jekyll build
Test the calendar parser: python3 site/bin/test_sync_calendar.py
Test the claim minter: python3 site/bin/test_mint_claim.py
Test the design tokens: python3 site/bin/test_tokens.py
Test the machine binding: python3 bin/test_binding.py
Test the wallpaper generator: python3 bin/test_make_wallpaper.py
Test the show proposer: python3 site/bin/test_propose_shows.py
Test the catalog report: python3 site/bin/test_catalog_report.py
Test the feed reader: python3 site/bin/test_sync_feeds.py
Test the library's x-ray: python3 bin/test_library.py
Test the workshed: python3 bin/test_workshed.py
Test the consoles and places: python3 bin/test_consoles.py
Test fcpm against its verbs: python3 bin/test_fcpm.py
Test the crew's supervisor: python3 bin/test_crew.py
Test the tier reader: python3 site/bin/test_sync_tiers.py
Test the subscription repricing: python3 site/bin/test_reprice_subscriptions.py
Test the deploy's tank guard (offline): python3 site/bin/test_tanks_live.py
Test the kiosk artifact builder: python3 bin/test_build_kiosk.py
Check the kiosk artifact is not stale: python3 bin/build-kiosk.py --check
Test the asks queue: python3 bin/test_asks.py
Test the member sites' builder: python3 bin/test_build_sites.py
Test the city catalog: python3 bin/test_city_catalog.py
Test the city's shapes: python3 bin/test_city_shapes.py
Test the helms: python3 bin/test_helms.py
Test the issues tape: python3 bin/test_issues.py
Test the keychain's door: python3 bin/test_keychain_door.py
Test the keys: python3 bin/test_keys.py
Test the lines: python3 bin/test_lines.py
Test model.ps1: python3 bin/test_model_ps1.py
Test the origin's door: python3 bin/test_origin_door.py
Test the origin's relay: python3 bin/test_origin_relay.py
Test the origin's traffic: python3 bin/test_origin_traffic.py
Test the post-receive hook: python3 bin/test_post_receive.py
Test the proofs: python3 bin/test_proof.py
Test the relay's door: python3 bin/test_relay_door.py
Test the replies: python3 bin/test_replies.py
Test the flat scopes: python3 bin/test_scopes.py
Test the seats: python3 bin/test_seats.py
Test the model spread: python3 bin/test_spread.py
Check no secret key reached the site: python3 site/bin/test_no_secrets.py
Check nothing internal reached the site: python3 site/bin/test_nothing_internal_is_published.py
Check the site runs no code: python3 site/bin/test_site_runs_no_code.py
Build the member site template and read its feed back: python3 site/bin/check-template.py
Install the page tests and their browser: cd site/tests && npm ci && npx playwright install chromium
Run the page tests: cd site/tests && npx playwright test --grep-invert @external
